entries.content:
task: 在每次回复末尾输出 <update> 标签，按以下规则更新变量

<status_current_variables>
world:
  time: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.world.time}}
  phase: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.world.phase}}
events:
  茶楼重逢.status: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.events.茶楼重逢.status}}
  茶楼重逢.deviation: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.events.茶楼重逢.deviation}}
  茶楼重逢.pressure: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.events.茶楼重逢.pressure}}
  夜访得信.status: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.events.夜访得信.status}}
  夜访得信.deviation: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.events.夜访得信.deviation}}
  夜访得信.pressure: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.events.夜访得信.pressure}}
characters:
  林昭.affinity: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.characters.林昭.affinity}}
  林昭.state: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.characters.林昭.state}}
  卡卡西.affinity: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.characters.卡卡西.affinity}}
  卡卡西.state: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.characters.卡卡西.state}}
custom:
  storylines.旧案追查.events: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.custom.storylines.旧案追查.events}}
  storylines.旧案追查.stage: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.custom.storylines.旧案追查.stage}}
  storylines.旧案追查.deviation: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.custom.storylines.旧案追查.deviation}}
  storylines.旧案追查.core: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.custom.storylines.旧案追查.core}}
user:
  name: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.user.name}}
  position: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.user.position}}
  identity: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.user.identity}}
  skills: {{get_message_variable::stat_data.user.skills}}
</status_current_variables>

rule: you must output variable update analysis in the end of the next reply

check list:
  - update 'world.time' 剧情推进后更新
  - update 'world.phase' 关键事件完成后切换，取值为「角色阶段」条目中定义的阶段名
  - update 'events.<事件名>.status' pending → ongoing → done / diverged
  - update 'events.<事件名>.deviation' 用户每做出与原作不同的关键选择，+20~40
  - update 'characters.<人名>.affinity' 0-100，根据互动 ±(3~6)
  - update 'characters.<人名>.state' 剧情导致的状态变化
  - update 'custom.storylines.<线名>.deviation' 该线的事件偏离时同步更新
  - update 'custom.storylines.<线名>.stage' 该线推进时更新阶段描述

format: |-
  <update>
  <update_analysis>$(IN ENGLISH, no more than 80 words)
  - 判断本轮推进了哪些事件
  - 判断用户是否干预了原著走向
  - 逐一检查每个变量的变化
  </update_analysis>
  _.set(stat_data.world.time, "${旧值}", "${新值}"); // ${理由}
  _.set(stat_data.events.${事件名}.status, "${旧值}", "${新值}"); // ${理由}
  _.set(stat_data.events.${事件名}.deviation, ${旧值}, ${新值}); // ${理由}
  _.set(stat_data.characters.${人名}.affinity, ${旧值}, ${新值}); // ${理由}
  </update>
